  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve access to reproductive health and gender-based violence services in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proejct aims to improve access to life-saving maternal, neonatal, and GBV response services, reduce preventable deaths and complications, and enhance the dignity, health, and safety of women and girls in Sudan&#x2019;s most affected areas.</narrative>
  </description>
